   "roundness": null,
   "text": "conductor close-out finishes its five steps, then STOPS and\ntells the human: 'run /kerd:switch out'. observed tonight\n(2026-08-06): the ask carried nothing to decide - the boundary\nwas mechanical, the wait was pure friction. after the boundary\nthe session sits quiet though TODO names the next pick.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "conductor close-out finishes its five steps, then STOPS and\ntells the human: 'run /kerd:switch out'. observed tonight\n(2026-08-06): the ask carried nothing to decide - the boundary\nwas mechanical, the wait was pure friction. after the boundary\nthe session sits quiet though TODO names the next pick.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
