   "roundness": null,
   "text": "conductor close-out gains step 6: INVOKE /kerd:switch out (the\nSkill tool - literal, proven: switch-in already chains into\nconductor the same way, observed twice tonight). the handoff\nask dies. at each task's verified commit, one line names the\nnext pick (plan step mid-spec; TODO Now/Backlog top after).\nthe banner ends: 'Free context: type /clear, then switch in'.",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "conductor close-out gains step 6: INVOKE /kerd:switch out (the\nSkill tool - literal, proven: switch-in already chains into\nconductor the same way, observed twice tonight). the handoff\nask dies. at each task's verified commit, one line names the\nnext pick (plan step mid-spec; TODO Now/Backlog top after).\nthe banner ends: 'Free context: type /clear, then switch in'.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
